1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,485
Do bigha zameen, aur paani bhi kam. Kheti se ghar nahi chalta.

2
00:00:04,785 --> 00:00:09,032
Manoj ji, zameen chhoti hai to kya! Ek kamre mein mushroom ugaiye!

3
00:00:09,332 --> 00:00:13,278
Mushroom? Wo to andhere mein ugne wali cheez hai na, Madam?

4
00:00:13,578 --> 00:00:19,048
Haan, aur yahi iska fayda hai. Bhoosa, beej aur 100 bag, 20 hazaar mein shuruaat.

5
00:00:19,348 --> 00:00:25,292
Krishi Vigyan Kendra se training lijiye. Kamre mein nami aur saaf-safai sabse zaroori hai.

6
00:00:25,842 --> 00:00:30,242
Oye Manoj! Dhabe ke liye roz 10 kilo taaza mushroom chahiye!

7
00:00:30,542 --> 00:00:34,021
Bilkul paaji, seedha farm se. 150 rupaye kilo.

8
00:00:34,321 --> 00:00:39,891
Har bag se dedh-do kilo. 100 bag se 45 din mein 22 hazaar se zyada.

9
00:00:40,191 --> 00:00:46,582
Phir 500 bag kijiye, aur sookha mushroom aur achaar banakar bechiye. Kuch bhi barbaad nahi.

10
00:00:46,882 --> 00:00:50,143
Chhoti zameen, badi kamai! Manoj ki life set!
